{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"离散赋值环"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"离散赋值环"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>一个离散赋值环是一个环 $A$ 带有一个映射 $v\\colon A\\to\\mathbb{Z}\\cup\\{\\infty \\}$, 满足 $v(ab)=v(a)+v(b)$, $v(a+b)\\geq\\operatorname{min}(v(a),v(b))$.</p>\n<p>等价的定义:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>仅有一个极大理想的"},{"Local":{"url":"主理想整环","text":"主理想整环"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>具有唯一不可约元的"},{"Local":{"url":"唯一分解整环","text":"唯一分解整环"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>…</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>离散赋值环是"},{"Local":{"url":"局部环","text":"局部环"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}